53
00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:31.050
and I told my husband,

54
00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.103
he wasn't allowed to come home anymore.

55
00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:38.090
He called some people that we love and trust

56
00:02:38.090 --> 00:02:40.863
who advised him to get help for himself.

57
00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:44.630
Yeah, I got to say this, just because, you know

58
00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:48.563
success is the warmest place to hide, especially for a man.

59
00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.930
The male ego tends to be its own animal.

60
00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:56.330 line:15%
And I had plenty of people telling me I was fine,

61
00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:58.560 line:15%
