62
00:02:58.560 --> 00:03:00.710 line:15%
In fact, you know what, now you're free,

63
00:03:00.710 --> 00:03:03.010 line:15%
you can do whatever you want, and you're like,

64
00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:04.403
but you know what?

65
00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:07.760
I want my wife, like I realized

66
00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:09.790
what I really needed in my life.

67
00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:13.710
I realized that anything without her was nothing,

68
00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.216
and I had to

69
00:03:15.216 --> 00:03:16.940
Right, it's like the old Joni Mitchell song.

70
00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.950
You don't know what you got till it's gone.

71
00:03:18.950 --> 00:03:19.990
That's it, that's it.

72
00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:21.880
